# Failing-first tests in tests/fm-project-capacity.test.sh, on upstream-lean (c7751ac2): test_two_fresh_spawns_in_one_home_both_publish, test_task_set_held_at_publication_defers_every_kind, test_machine_total_is_rechecked_at_publication_in_one_home and test_away_spend_cap_is_rechecked_at_publication are red because a second fresh spawn in one home exits 1 "this home's task set is locked by another spawn" while the first is still starting (agent-config .agent-config-1ep1j: the lock busy 70% of the time, 20-78 s per spawn). test_forced_teardown_during_a_spawns_start_is_never_missed is red there because the teardown cannot take the set, and red on the narrow hold without the epoch check because the spawn then publishes into the torn-down home. test_same_home_spawn_during_headroom_reading_takes_the_extra_start is red there because the spawn exits 75 "headroom reading". All are green after this change.
